@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@customerToken = pega-aqui-el-accessToken-del-login-customer
@operatorToken = pega-aqui-el-accessToken-del-login-operator
@adminToken = pega-aqui-el-accessToken-del-login-admin

### Chequeo de salud público
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health
X-Correlation-ID: http-health-001

### Nombres de métricas
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/metrics
Authorization: Bearer {{operatorToken}}
X-Correlation-ID: http-metrics-001

### Métricas Prometheus
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/prometheus
Authorization: Bearer {{operatorToken}}
X-Correlation-ID: http-prometheus-001

### Métrica custom de transferencias exitosas
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/metrics/bank.transfers.successful
Authorization: Bearer {{operatorToken}}
X-Correlation-ID: http-metric-transfer-success-001
